# Generated CI test-report artifacts -- these are produced fresh by every
# mobile-tests/selenium-tests run (see mobile-tests/conftest.py +
# generate_reports.py) and must never be committed. A stale committed
# execution-results.json is exactly what caused a real, in-progress CI run
# that got killed mid-way to silently report "0 tests, gate FAILED"
# instead of surfacing that hundreds of tests had actually run and failed.
mobile-tests/reports/*
!mobile-tests/reports/logs/.gitkeep
!mobile-tests/reports/screenshots/.gitkeep